@AskMyNotes_HostAddress = http://localhost:5137

### How many chunks are stored. 0 means the ingest has not run, or found nothing.
GET {{AskMyNotes_HostAddress}}/dbcheck

### Read every folder in Notes:Roots and replace the stored chunks with what is there.
GET {{AskMyNotes_HostAddress}}/ingest

### Ask a question. The answer cites the files it came from, and says it does not know
### rather than inventing one when the notes do not cover it.
POST {{AskMyNotes_HostAddress}}/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "What do my notes say about handling retries?"
}

### Run the labelled question set through the same retrieval path /ask uses.
### Needs eval/golden_set.json, which is not in this repository — see NOTES.md.
GET {{AskMyNotes_HostAddress}}/eval
